Apple Pay domain verification.

Razorpay Dashboard > Apple Pay > "Verification file" downloads a file named
    apple-developer-merchantid-domain-association
(no extension). Place it in THIS directory and commit it, so every deploy
keeps serving it — Apple re-checks the file periodically, not just once.

It must then answer, over HTTPS, with no redirect, at:
    https://sirieducation.com/.well-known/apple-developer-merchantid-domain-association
    https://www.sirieducation.com/.well-known/apple-developer-merchantid-domain-association

See docs/deployment/apple-pay-domain-verification.md for the full runbook.
